lity of selection and nonresponse, as well as noncoverage\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"These sampling weights were used to calculate all estimates and 95% confidence intervals.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For comparisons of prevalence between men and women, statistical significance (p<0.05) was determined using a two-sided z-test.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Data were weighted to be representative of the state/area population.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Confidence interval half-width >10, which might indicate an unreliable estimate.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}